<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Defs_L3_3_6_5" targetNamespace="https://teck.example/process-models/pillar-03">
  <bpmn:collaboration id="Collab_L3_3_6_5">
    <bpmn:participant id="Pool_L3_3_6_5" name="3.6.5 Site Water Balance &amp; Reconciliation" processRef="Process_L3_3_6_5"/>
  </bpmn:collaboration>
  <bpmn:process id="Process_L3_3_6_5" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:documentation>L3 Process. Brings the water flow and volume records from 3.3, 3.5 and 3.6 together for each reporting period, applies the water-system boundaries and allocation rules, and closes the site water balance. Composite figures (e.g., total plant water use) must count each volume once. Metric definitions and formulas belong in Stage 2.</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:laneSet id="LaneSet_L3_3_6_5">
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_L3_3_6_5_rep" name="Water Balance Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Start_L3_3_6_5_s</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_3_6_5_3_6_5_1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_3_6_5_3_6_5_2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_3_6_5_3_6_5_3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Gw_L3_3_6_5_g</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_3_6_5_3_6_5_4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>End_L3_3_6_5_e</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_L3_3_6_5_wat" name="Water Operator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_3_6_5_n</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
    </bpmn:laneSet>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="Start_L3_3_6_5_s" name="Reporting period end">
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_6_5_1</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_3_6_5_3_6_5_1" name="3.6.5.1 Compile Water Flow and Volume Data">
      <bpmn:documentation>Period totals are compiled for every metered transfer (WP-01 to WP-10) and storage inventories (WP-11), with meter status and data gaps flagged.
ISA-95 level: 3
Actors: Water Balance Analyst
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Level 3; MCA WAF
DDVC layer: Curated (water_transfer_record)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_6_5_1</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_6_5_2</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_3_6_5_3_6_5_2" name="3.6.5.2 Apply Water System Boundaries and Allocation Rules">
      <bpmn:documentation>Each transfer is assigned to its water system and boundary (supply, process water, tailings facility, remote locations), any shared-supply allocation is applied, and internal recycles are identified so they are not counted as inputs.
ISA-95 level: 3
Actors: Water Balance Analyst; Water Operator
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Level 3; MCA WAF
DDVC layer: Curated (water_transfer_record — allocation attribute)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_6_5_2</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_6_5_3</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_3_6_5_3_6_5_3" name="3.6.5.3 Close Period Water Balance">
      <bpmn:documentation>For each water system, inputs minus outputs are compared with the change in storage; evaporation, entrainment in deposited tailings and unrecovered seepage are estimated where not measured; the remainder is the balance error, checked against tolerance.
ISA-95 level: 3
Actors: Water Balance Analyst
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Level 3; MCA WAF; ICMM water reporting guidance
DDVC layer: Curated (water_balance_record)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_6_5_3</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_6_5_4</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Gw_L3_3_6_5_g" name="Balance within tolerance?" default="Flow_L3_3_6_5_5">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_6_5_4</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_6_5_5</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_6_5_6</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_3_6_5_3_6_5_4" name="3.6.5.4 Publish Water and Tailings Performance Data">
      <bpmn:documentation>The closed water balance is released together with the period's tailings records (deposited, placed, surveyed, storage and capacity status) as the governed data for water and tailings reporting.
ISA-95 level: 3 / 4
Actors: Water Balance Analyst; Environmental Officer
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Level 4 (business reporting)
DDVC layer: Curated (water_balance_record, tailings_deposition_record)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_6_5_5</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_6_5_7</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_6_5_8</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_L3_3_6_5_e" name="Period data published">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_6_5_8</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:messageEventDefinition id="Msg_L3_3_6_5_e"/>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_3_6_5_n" name="Investigate meters, allocation and storage estimates">
      <bpmn:documentation>Derived from the Process Flow Narratives section (not a row in the Process Decomposition). Water balance closure failure path; no L4 row.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_6_5_6</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_6_5_7</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_6_5_1" sourceRef="Start_L3_3_6_5_s" targetRef="Task_L3_3_6_5_3_6_5_1"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_6_5_2" sourceRef="Task_L3_3_6_5_3_6_5_1" targetRef="Task_L3_3_6_5_3_6_5_2"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_6_5_3" sourceRef="Task_L3_3_6_5_3_6_5_2" targetRef="Task_L3_3_6_5_3_6_5_3"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_6_5_4" sourceRef="Task_L3_3_6_5_3_6_5_3" targetRef="Gw_L3_3_6_5_g"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_6_5_5" name="Yes" sourceRef="Gw_L3_3_6_5_g" targetRef="Task_L3_3_6_5_3_6_5_4"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_6_5_6" name="No" sourceRef="Gw_L3_3_6_5_g" targetRef="Task_L3_3_6_5_n"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_6_5_7" sourceRef="Task_L3_3_6_5_n" targetRef="Task_L3_3_6_5_3_6_5_4"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_6_5_8" sourceRef="Task_L3_3_6_5_3_6_5_4" targetRef="End_L3_3_6_5_e"/>
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="Diagram_L3_3_6_5">
    <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="Plane_L3_3_6_5" bpmnElement="Collab_L3_3_6_5">
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Pool_L3_3_6_5_di" bpmnElement="Pool_L3_3_6_5" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="20" y="20" width="1436" height="340"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_L3_3_6_5_rep_di" bpmnElement="Lane_L3_3_6_5_rep" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="60" y="20" width="1396" height="170"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_L3_3_6_5_wat_di" bpmnElement="Lane_L3_3_6_5_wat" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="60" y="190" width="1396" height="170"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Start_L3_3_6_5_s_di" bpmnElement="Start_L3_3_6_5_s"><dc:Bounds x="142" y="77" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="110" y="139" width="120" height="28"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_3_6_5_3_6_5_1_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_3_6_5_3_6_5_1"><dc:Bounds x="266" y="65" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_3_6_5_3_6_5_2_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_3_6_5_3_6_5_2"><dc:Bounds x="472" y="65" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_3_6_5_3_6_5_3_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_3_6_5_3_6_5_3"><dc:Bounds x="678" y="65" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Gw_L3_3_6_5_g_di" bpmnElement="Gw_L3_3_6_5_g" isMarkerVisible="true"><dc:Bounds x="934" y="70" width="70" height="70"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="863" y="34" width="100" height="28"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_3_6_5_3_6_5_4_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_3_6_5_3_6_5_4"><dc:Bounds x="1090" y="65" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="End_L3_3_6_5_e_di" bpmnElement="End_L3_3_6_5_e"><dc:Bounds x="1328" y="77" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="1296" y="139" width="120" height="28"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_3_6_5_n_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_3_6_5_n"><dc:Bounds x="884" y="235" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_6_5_1_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_6_5_1"><di:waypoint x="198" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="266" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_6_5_2_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_6_5_2"><di:waypoint x="436" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="472" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_6_5_3_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_6_5_3"><di:waypoint x="642" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="678" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_6_5_4_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_6_5_4"><di:waypoint x="848" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="934" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_6_5_5_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_6_5_5"><di:waypoint x="1004" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="1090" y="105"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="1008" y="85" width="27" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_6_5_6_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_6_5_6"><di:waypoint x="969" y="140"/><di:waypoint x="969" y="235"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="975" y="144" width="21" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_6_5_7_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_6_5_7"><di:waypoint x="1054" y="275"/><di:waypoint x="1175" y="275"/><di:waypoint x="1175" y="145"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_6_5_8_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_6_5_8"><di:waypoint x="1260" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="1328" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
    </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
  </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
</bpmn:definitions>
